  "aboutUs":{
    "title":"About us",
    "whoWeAreOne":"Who is the",
    "whoWeAreTwo":"Church of God of Prophecy?",
    "textOne":"The Church of God of Prophecy is a vibrant Christian movement, rooted in Scripture, firm in faith, and resolute in its passion for people. It is a worldwide body of believers, united in worship, working together to share God's love and a message of hope with those who suffer.",
    "textTwo":"The impact of the Church of God of Prophecy is profound. It is estimated that every 24 hours, around the world, 300 people receive salvation, nearly 100 are baptized, and more than 14,000 preaching locations actively proclaim the gospel. At least one new church opens its doors every day to impact a local community thanks to the efforts of this movement.",
    "textThree":"The Church is ethnically and culturally diverse, and 90% of its members reside outside of North America. Currently, the Church ministers in 133 countries, with over 1,400 new members each month. An estimated 14,000 men and women are authorized to preach the gospel in pastoral and evangelistic roles."
  },
